    "description_md": "Continuous Underway Fish Egg Sampler (CUFES) egg counts (sardine, anchovy, jack mackerel, hake, squid, other) and eggs per cubic metre pumped, from CalCOFI cruises since 1996. Sampling is ongoing; the processed record reaches April 2022 and SWFSC's processing lags its staffing (Ed Weber, 2026-10-14). Squid eggs are Abraliopsis felis, the only squid in the region with pelagic eggs. Source: SWFSC's CSV export of its CalCOFI database (Cufes.csv, linked to the cruise list by CruiseId); until release v2026.10.01 the same records were read from NOAA CoastWatch ERDDAP erdCalCOFIcufes.\n",
    "keywords": ["EARTH SCIENCE > BIOLOGICAL CLASSIFICATION > ANIMALS/VERTEBRATES > FISH", "EARTH SCIENCE > BIOLOGICAL CLASSIFICATION > ANIMALS/VERTEBRATES > FISH > RAY-FINNED FISHES > ANCHOVIES/HERRINGS", "Fish Abundance and Biodiversity", "CalCOFI Network"],
